    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "TRANS WORLD SERVICE\nDUBALIN",
      "Welcome Noard\nSalad\nGARDEN SALAD BOWL\nFresh Garden Greens in Season Tossed with Crisp\nColorful Vegetables and Garnishes... Served\nwith our Dressing of the Day.\nDesserts\nFROM THE PATISSERIE\nOur Swiss Tart with Vanilla Mousse,\nFruit Tidbits and a Hint of Kirsch\nNested in a Graham Cracker Crust.\nTobler Chocolate\nBauerages\nCOFFEE FLAVORS OF THE WORLD at $1.00 Each\nThe Perfect Touch of Hot Coffee and Whipped\nCream, It's the Spirit that Makes the Difference!\nCafe Grand Marnier\nRoyale with Cognac\nA Continental Breakfast\nwill be offered on this flight.\nFrans World Specialties\nWherever We Fly, We Have the Enviable Opportunity to Taste\nand Savor the Cuisines of Each Land. You are Invited to\nShare Some of Our All Time Favorites.\nSALISBURY STEAK BORDELAISE\nAn American favorite! A hearty grilled U.S. choice\nresented with o Brien potatoes and parsley whole caute\nCHICKEN BREAST NEW ENGLAND\nA Partially Boned Breast of Chicken\nwith a Traditional New England Stuffing\nof Bread Crumbs, Apples, Celery, Onions\nand Seasonings... Complemented by Sauce\nSupreme, and Served with Au Gratin\nPotatoes and Green Peas with Pimentos.\nSEAFOOD NEWBURG\nPoached Fillet of Sole, Tender Scallops\nand Shrimp in a Sherry Flavored Sauce.\nAccompanied by a Nest of Buttered Rice\nand Green Beans Amandine.\nPlease accept our apologies\nif your choice is not available on this flight.\nDC-61\n105"
    ],
